# EZAuth Web Configuration Template
# Copy to .env.local for local development
# Copy to .env.production for Vercel deployment

# ======================
# SERVER CONFIGURATION
# ======================
# Port is managed by @ezstart/config via getWebPort() — do not set here

# ======================
# API CONFIGURATION
# ======================
# EZAuth API URL
# Development: Local API on port 6110
# Production: Railway deployed API

# ======================
# PRODUCTION EXAMPLES
# ======================
# Web (Vercel): https://ezauth.ezstart.xyz
# API (Railway): https://ezauth-api.up.railway.app
